{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Create site audit"},"description":"Cr\u00e9er le rapport d\u2019audit d\u2019un site test\u00e9 de bout en bout (Testeur MonAssoci\u00e9), priv\u00e9 au projet. Idempotent par requestId : rappeler renvoie le m\u00eame audit (reprise). Retourne id, reportUrl et markdownUrl (t\u00e9l\u00e9chargement complet, session d\u2019un membre du projet). Ensuite update_site_audit par lots pendant le test, captures par start_site_audit_screenshot, puis close_site_audit. Ne jamais envoyer de mot de passe : tout secret re\u00e7u est masqu\u00e9.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"meta":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"executiveSummary":{"maxLength":6000,"type":"string"},"modules":{"items":{"enum":["fonctionnel","parcours","mobile","navigation","guide","technique","api","donnees","qualite","securite","reproduction"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":11,"type":"array"},"notes":{"items":{"maxLength":1000,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"origin":{"maxLength":2048,"type":"string"},"pagesPlanned":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"phase":{"maxLength":40,"type":"string"},"resources":{"items":{"maxLength":1024,"type":"string"},"maxItems":200,"type":"array"},"routes":{"items":{"maxLength":500,"type":"string"},"maxItems":1000,"type":"array"},"scope":{"maxLength":512,"type":"string"},"sitemap":{"items":{"maxLength":1024,"type":"string"},"maxItems":1000,"type":"array"},"stack":{"items":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"maxItems":100,"type":"array"},"startedAt":{"maxLength":40,"type":"string"},"testedBy":{"maxLength":120,"type":"string"},"title":{"maxLength":200,"type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"origin":{"format":"uri","maxLength":2048,"type":"string"},"requestId":{"description":"Identifiant stable du test : rappeler avec la m\u